				"content": "## Governance feature verification (run nodes IN SEQUENCE, see step order below)\n\n**Step 1 -- Budget cap**: execute 'Run Start (budget=100)' then 'Task (budget probe)'. EXPECTED: the task node FAILS with 409 (budget/quota denial) -- that 409 IS the acceptance signal: budget_max_units reached the ledger (the old node silently dropped this field).\n\n**Step 2 -- Tools whitelist**: execute 'Run Start (tools)' then 'Task (whitelist=search)'. EXPECTED: succeeded -- the tools whitelist rides TaskDescriptor.tools.\n\n**Step 3 -- Cancel operation**: execute 'Task (slow, no wait)' then IMMEDIATELY (within the 30s window) execute 'Cancel Run'. EXPECTED: {status: cancelled, cancelled_tasks: [slow-probe-...]}.\n\n**Step 4 -- Evidence chain (viewer cold path, works even after the run is closed -- D14 by design)**: execute the three Evidence nodes with Run ID = verify-tools: Validate Bundle (available: true), Get Dependency Graph (edges array), List Generations (execution_id rows). Get Generation returns 501 on a memory-mode gateway (design behavior; needs the compose/redis stack).\n\nAll ids are FIXED TEXT (no expressions) so every node can execute standalone. Set the credential on every node after import."
